{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_2000_place", "source_sha256": "be584f9a34885930e28a54681c23595dcfc6bbad8df828be82d15b59b7b59568", "ja": "スタジオ袖", "zh": "摄影棚侧边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_2001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ad5d4bcf1acd29f21ff70ddcacab364419ca80d0801750e3cf8ce97cd32ac9d1", "ja": "……マイガーッ！　やっちゃったよ……。", "zh": "……My God！搞砸啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_2002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0a65ead35224ddca2cb277aa99658d45b50db879e50fd018bf16bfef9461fbbc", "ja": "うう……緊張して、一曲目の出だし間違えるなんて……\nやっぱりアタシ、歌の方はまだまだだなぁ～……。", "zh": "呜呜……竟然紧张到第一首的开头就出错……\n果然，我在唱歌方面还有很多努力空间啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_2003_p", "source_sha256": "0189fc2e2ae4d710a2d6bef36bd5ed7ac3693dd87e46e0a00915af9c14cc3ba9", "ja": "あれ、そうだったのか？　歩のダンスパフォーマンスに\n夢中で、全然、気づかなかったよ。", "zh": "咦，有吗？我光顾着欣赏步的舞蹈表演，\n完全没注意到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_2004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7dfd899e2906eb3591cdeeefe102d524750fbbe71ec8b7379b57d8089424522b", "ja": "へっ？　そ、そう？　なら、よかっ……\nいや、よくない！　全然よくない！", "zh": "咦？是、是吗？那就好……\n不，不好！一点也不好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_2005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bea7810a373fbe81e076d422f4ca29692d1db4fdaf521257b2f654b0487c16be", "ja": "やっぱ、ニガテはきっちり乗り越えないとなっ。\nそのためには、努力あるのみっ！", "zh": "弱点还是得正面克服才行啊！\n为了达成目标，只能好好努力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_034ayu_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_034ayu_2006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "045facf69c8a7a86a9d553ec5ea64b373957d0d5d953f262569e05757c1809e3", "ja": "そのためには、実践あるのみっ！　歌の仕事、\nガンガン入れてよね、{$P$}！", "zh": "为了达成目标，只能好好实践了！尽管帮我安排\n唱歌的工作吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
